---
import { PreviewNavbar } from '../components/layout/PreviewNavbar';
---
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>About v1 - Brutalist</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-white text-black font-sans antialiased selection:bg-black selection:text-white">
  <PreviewNavbar client:load variationName="Minimalist v1" />
  <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-24">
    <header class="mb-32">
      <h1 class="text-7xl md:text-9xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter leading-none mb-8">
        We build<br/>software.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium max-w-3xl leading-snug">
        No distractions. Just performance, reliability, and scale. We write code that works, so you can focus on your business.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 mb-32 border-t-4 border-black pt-16">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold uppercase mb-4">Our Method</h2>
        <p class="text-lg">
          We strip away the unnecessary. Every feature, every line of code must justify its existence. This ruthless prioritization results in faster, more resilient systems.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold uppercase mb-4">The Team</h2>
        <p class="text-lg">
          Small, autonomous groups of senior engineers. We don't do middle management. You speak directly to the people building your product.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="border-t-4 border-black pt-16">
      <h2 class="text-6xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter mb-12">Core Principles</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="border-2 border-black p-8 hover:bg-black hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">01. Speed</h3>
          <p>Slow systems fail. We optimize for latency at every layer of the stack.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-2 border-black p-8 hover:bg-black hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">02. Clarity</h3>
          <p>Complex architectures hide bugs. We favor simple, understandable designs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-2 border-black p-8 hover:bg-black hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">03. Ownership</h3>
          <p>You build it, you run it. Complete accountability for the software lifecycle.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>


